  "name": "Black Cod With Miso",
  "text": "Black Cod With Miso\n\nPreparation time:\n\nCooking time:\n\nYield: 4\n\nIngredients\n\n4 fillets of black cod,\n\n3 cups (800g) Nobu-Style Saikyo Miso,\n\n1 stalk hajikami (to garnish).\n\nPreparation\n\n1.Pat the fillets dry with a paper towel. Slather the fish with the miso sauce, place in a bowl, cover with plastic wrap, and leave in the fridge for 2-3 days.\n\n2. Preheat the oven to gas 6 (200C, 400F). Preheat the grill. Lightly wipe off any excess miso, but don’t rinse it off. Grill, skin side toward the heat, until the skin crisps up. Then bake for 10-15 minutes.\n\n3. Garnish with the hajikami and add a few drops of the sauce to the plate.",
  "recipeYield": "4",
